#: scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ad00f83b75ab1c53f45d948e01415f88da294a0b6333e8e16de61b323268978
