msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is a little bit of fog out today.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Weather like this "
"reminds me of my home country.⟪k:6⟫"
