#: scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 403d0d4bddfbe63e32b38bc753e25218a765994aa5c1d31a4869e3e8384bb151
#. default-sha256: 24c72a1ecb43bb60eca41adaac2c6199270865c8ec860e8e2ab81fe2495fea5f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was born on an island perpetually covered in a thick fog.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m not saying I "
"would like to return, but thinking about it does make me feel rather homesick. ⟪k:4⟫Does that "
"happen to you?⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫因为我出生的国家，⟪k:1⟫是多雾的地方。⟪k:2⟫我并不是想要回去。⟪k:3⟫但是，⟪k:4⟫回忆起故乡就会变"
"得感伤起来不是吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe2931519861067fc87d42baefa8eb2f890df6b126c73eff177de6e9eb675915
